{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /Users/ben/github/toulmin/evals/toulmin/variants/ask-only/skills/toulmin\n\n# Writing the piece\n\nBefore you write, ask the user for what you are missing. Send one message with at most five questions, the most useful first. Ask only what would change the piece and what the request does not already answer. When the answers come back, write the piece as you normally would, and hand it over. When the user does not know something, write without it and do not guess.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: Win-back email to 97 lapsed CSA farm share members who didn't renew after a July 9 hailstorm halved boxes for 6 weeks with no refund/credit and only one short email. Under 200 words. Facts: $540 same price; new higher-ground second field + 2 hail nets over tomatoes/peppers ($31,000); new pause up to 2 weeks with credit; sign-up closes March 15; 52 shares left."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"171d8507-b332-4fe6-a2b2-647d2c5e6760","uuid":"d6eee27f-4bb1-4dc4-a5de-67e164009544","timestamp":"2026-11-16T20:24:42.957Z","isSynthetic":true}
