{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7EV1MU9hhUtaK3paSTr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Your answers will change what the email says:\n\n1. **How much do you want to own last summer?** You gave no refund or credit and sent one short email. I'd suggest saying plainly that you handled it badly. Are you comfortable with that, or would you rather just acknowledge the storm?\n2. **Do you know why these 97 left?** For example, did people reply, complain, or mention the hail? If most left for other reasons (they moved, had too much produce, the price), the email should lead with something else.\n3. **Can you offer anything to returning members?** Some options are a small discount, a free week, or credit toward last year's short boxes. If not, that's fine. I'll make the case using the field, the nets and the new pause option.\n4. **Would the new field and nets have saved what you lost in July?** For instance, were the lost crops mostly tomatoes and peppers, or crops in low-lying ground? I want to claim only what's true.\n5. **What are the farm name, your sign-off name and the sign-up link?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":573,"cache_read_input_tokens":9517,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":573},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"171d8507-b332-4fe6-a2b2-647d2c5e6760","uuid":"949356d8-d74e-4c9a-9995-f3beba5761af","timestamp":"2026-11-16T20:24:50.292Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7EV15Lqr8fv6wqhmreF"}
